    "detail": {
      "id": 1350021,
      "name": "[Ellen] Arctic Hunt",
      "desc": "Every 15s, Ellen applies a <color=#FFFFFF>Hunting</color> mark that lasts for 15 to a random enemy. When hitting an enemy marked with <color=#FFFFFF>Hunting</color> with <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> or Swift Scissors/Charged Scissor Strike from <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Arctic Ambush</color>, pressing Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> or Special Attack <IconMap:Icon_Special> allows Ellen to <color=#2BAD00>immediately trigger the skill again</color> with <color=#2BAD00>no cost or other requirements</color>. When she obtains <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color>, each excess point of <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases Ellen's ATK by 12%</color>. This effect lasts for 10s and stacks up to 9 times. The duration of each stack is calculated separately.",
